  "js": "(()=>{const C=window.CITY,out={inPoly:0,onBlock:0,ids:[]};for(const code of ['6006','6004']){const t=C.POLES.types[code];let id=0;for(let i=0;i<t.ids.length;i++){id+=t.ids[i];const x=t.xz[2*i]/10,z=t.xz[2*i+1]/10;if(C.biidaasigeParkInside?.(x,z)){out.inPoly++;if(C.blockAt(x,z)&&!C.BIIDAASIGE_STALE_CITY_POLE_IDS.includes(id)){out.onBlock++;out.ids.push(id);}}}}console.log('poles-in-park',JSON.stringify({out,rejected:C.poleStats.rejected,lighting:C.biidaasigeLighting.stats}));return out;})()"
